  "pass_definition": "#102 episode rule (run_closed_loop_evaluation.episodes / episode_view): attempt k is the agent's k-th reset to the level start; the episode ends at the first pass or the first typed failure (no transferable shot, or a stage-B execution that did not complete), so attempts after a typed failure are not counted; pass@k = 1 iff the episode passed within its first k attempts. Unlike #102, an attempt cannot exclude earlier failed launches (the agent chooses afresh after every reset). One cell per level (no model seeds). An agent the smoke found deterministic gets one attempt per level (a reset replays the same shot), so its pass@3 is not run (null) and pass@1 is its only row.",
